Z||000000||Bob Englert||12-07-2001||01:14 PM||||Tarheel Fieros lunch meeting this Saturday at Concord Mills Mall!<P>Bryan Wilkinson has arranged lunch at Macado's in Concord Mills Mall for this Saturday (12/8).  This restaurant is in the mall near the theater entrance. Bryan made arrangements for 10-15 people for a little after 1:00 PM. Concord Mills mall is just off I-85 at the Speedway Blvd. exit.<P>If anyone from Greensboro or east is interested in driving down together we<BR>can meet at 4 Seasons Mall in Greensboro in front of the hotel (near the eastbound I-40 to mall flyover) at about 11:15 AM.  I will be in the parking lot by 11:00 if anyone wants to join me for the drive down.<P>Gary Flyntus will have his new 3.4L powered 85 with him if anyone is interested in the 3.4L conversion.  Jack Cooke won't have his Gold GT with him due to a close encounter with a pickup truck.<P>We would welcome any new Fiero owners to some and join us for lunch and some story swapping.<P><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
Z||000001||LZeitgeist||12-07-2001||03:15 PM||||I hate I'm gonna miss this one, but I've already got a weekend full of stuff to do... Also, I don't want to subject my current clutch (or what's left of it) to a trip of that distance.<P>(BTW, thanks for the offer of the use of your car, Hoop... if I had time to go this weekend, I'd be glad to take you up on the offer!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)<P>Have fun, guys! Take pics!||||reg||1
